# Running a live integration test's fixture project (vitest-project or
# vitest-project-select) writes a transform cache to node_modules/.vite
# through the symlinked/ancestor node_modules it resolves against (see
# the tsc-vitest disjointness note in verify.test.ts). Neither fixture
# ships a node_modules of its own; this ignores whatever a real run
# leaves behind for either one. Both tests clean this up themselves
# (try/finally around the run), so a leftover directory here means a
# prior run was interrupted before its cleanup ran, not a required
# artifact.
node_modules/
